break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！すごいよ！！褒めてくださったのよ...（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しすぎるっっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に頑張って良かったって思った心の底から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/18/7744948/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/18/7744948/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかさ去年の夏に氣志團フェスに出させていただときはまさかこうして自分が氣志團さんとの対バンで歌わせてもらえるとは思ってもみなかったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「俺んとここないか？」はあみが言いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここはなぜかスタッフさんにどうしても笑われる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁぜぇ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/18/7744948/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん（ひめたん）とのコンビはコウモリから結構恒例になってきつつあるのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただめーちゃんは声が高くてあみは低いから、なかなか音域が合わなくて若干あみはサビのところがキツかったっす。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、まあそのおかげで少しは高音がでるようになったからいいんだけど